<p>jab qatl kiya nahar pa saqqa-e- haram ko<br />
bhaai ka diya daagh shahinshaah-e umam ko<br />
paani na diya pyaas me us bahr-e- karam ko<br />
tha shor ke ab qouf kisi ka nahi'n ham ko</p>

<p>ghaazi ko jigar band-e- yadullah ko maara<br />
abbas ko kya qatl kiya shaah ko maara<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aada to ye kehte the shah-e-dee'n ka ye tha haal<br />
tar aansuo'n se hota tha rumaal pa rumaal<br />
farmaate the kya hogaye abbas-e- qush iqbaal<br />
dunya me nahi jeene ka ab fatima ka laal</p>

<p>bin bhai basar hogi na ek aan hamaari<br />
abbas ke maatam me gayi jaan hamaari<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bekas huwe ab koi nahi hamdam-o- yaawar<br />
paaenge kaha'n aisa wafaadar baradar<br />
bar aaye kahi'n aarzu-e- sibte payambar<br />
jaldi meri gardan pa chale zulm ka qanjar</p>

<p>dushman pa bhi ye aalam-e- tanhaai na howe<br />
jeene ka mazaa khaak hai jab bhaai na howe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kahke tadapne lage sultan-e- do aalam<br />
barpaa tha ajab qaima-e- shabbir me maatam<br />
chillati thi zainab ke jigar phat-ta hai is dam<br />
bhaai ke alam me na jiyenge shah-e- akram</p>

<p>andher jaha'n hai jo alamdar nahi hai<br />
koi mere bhaai ka madadgaar nahi hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>samjhaake use ran ko chale jab shah-e- abraar<br />
doudi aqab-e- shaah sakina jigar afgaar<br />
chillai ke baba mujhe yaa'n chodho na zinhaar<br />
dikhlaado mujhe laasha-e- abbas-e- alamdar</p>

<p>paani na mila margaye wo qoo'n me naha kar<br />
mai roungi ab laasha-e- abbas pa jaakar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dekhaa jo use shaah ne ba deeda-e- giryaa'n<br />
kahne lage beti se basad naala-o- afghaa'n<br />
maare na koi teer tumhe dushman-e- imaa'n<br />
chalna tera laashe pa munaasib nahi is aa'n</p>

<p>wo kahti thi mai ji se guzar jaaungi baba<br />
waa'n leke na chaliyega to marjaaungi ba ba<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aaqir use darya ki taraf leke chale shaah<br />
yu kahne lage fouj se badh kar kayi gumraah<br />
kya qasd hai jaate ho kidhar aye shah -e- zeejaah<br />
darya pa wo maare gaye thi jinki tumhe chaah</p>

<p>paani ke liye laakh jawaanou'n se lade hai<br />
aur haath kataaye huwe reti pa pade hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>naagaah nazar aaya unhe laasha-e- abbas<br />
chilla ke kaha haaye ham ab hogaye be aas<br />
pohanhenge na tum tak tha yahi bhaai ko waswaas<br />
ab koun bujhaayega sakina ki bhala pyaas</p>

<p>haathou'n ke tasadduq tan-e- sad paash ke sadqe<br />
aye jaan-e- baradar mai teri laash ke sadqe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aankhou'n ko zara kholo to qurbaan ho bhaai<br />
qaime se sakina tumhe lene ko hai aayi<br />
kyu ret me ye chaand si surat hai chupaai<br />
sar peet ke tab kehne lagi shaah ki jaai</p>

<p>hai hai mujhe surat nahi dikhlaate hai ammu<br />
mai pyaasi rahi isliye sharmaate hai ammu<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tadpi jo ye keh keh ke sakina jigar afgaar<br />
tharrane laga laasha-e- abbas-e- alamdar<br />
laashe se lipat kar ye pukaare shah-e- abrar<br />
sadqe teri ulfat ke hussain aye mere ghamqwaar</p>

<p>rone na diya tha kabhi is tashna dahaa'n ko<br />
tharrathe ho ab sunke sakina ki fughaa'n ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qaatoon-e- qayamat ki sada itne me aai<br />
maara gaya hae hae mere shabbir ka bhaai<br />
farzand se farmaya ye de de ke duhaai<br />
pursaa tumhe deti hai ye gardoo ki sataai</p>

<p>shabbar bhi basad dard-o- bukaa peet rahe the<br />
laashe ke qaree'n shere quda peet rahe the<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye sunke tadapne laga abbas ka dildaar<br />
chillaya ke ab hogaye ham bekas-o- naachaar<br />
ham jeete rahe qatl huwa shaah ka ghamqhaar<br />
ta hashr na ab dekhenge ham baap ka deedaar</p>

<p>is umr me kya zulm-o- sitam hogaye hae hae<br />
faryaad ke bin baap ke ham hogaye hae hae<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>